<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40438" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπάρειμι</span></b>  (B), (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶμι</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ibo</i>) <i>march on high
				ground parallel with</i> one below, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				3.4.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.13.3
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c.
			dat., <i>proceed to attack</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπαριὼν τῷ δεξιῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					5.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>. <i>come to
				one's assistance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				4.108
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ δέοι τι . . , ἐπιπαρῇσαν οὗτοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					3.4.23
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιπαριόντες</span> ib. <i><span class="en">
				30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>. <i>pass
				along the front of</i> an army, so as to address it (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάρειμι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					1v
				</span></i>
			. <i><span class="en">
				2
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.67
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				7.76
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. κατὰ πρόσωπον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.83.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>. <i>visit in
				passing</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φρυγίαν,
			Μυσίαν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				App.
				<u>BC</u>
				5.7
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
